# Local development configuration
# Do not commit real API keys.

# IncidentLens uses ADK's LiteLLM integration with OpenAI by default.
# Set this in your shell or uncomment for local-only development:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Optional model override:
# INCIDENTLENS_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini
